"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[60893],{60893:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<RestaurantCard\\n  cover=\\"/assets/snippets/location/98b0de32b3a671edb52eb620d242f99c.jpg\\"\\n  title=\\"Songjeong Beach Makguksu Haeundae Branch\\"\\n  cuisine=\\"Korean\\"\\n  address=\\"Jwadongsunhwan-ro 446beon-gil, Haeundae-gu, Busan\\"\\n  rating=3.5\\n  tags=\\"restaurant\\"\\n/>\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nIt\'s well known as a regular spot for the late Chung Ju-yung, honorary chairman of Hyundai Group, who enjoyed it so much that he would visit by helicopter whenever he was in Gangwon-do.  \\nAlthough the main restaurant is in Gangwon-do, I visited with confidence as it\'s a branch that inherited the same flavor.  \\n\\nThe `mul-makguksu` (cold buckwheat noodles in broth) is said to be characterized by its mild taste.  \\n\\nHowever, I was more in the mood for `bibim-makguksu` (spicy buckwheat noodles) that day, so I ordered two.  \\nNaturally, I ordered one as a double portion.  \\nI also ordered a `buckwheat pancake`.  \\n\\nI ordered a double portion based on the typical amount of makguksu in Seoul, but I was surprised by how generous the portion was.  \\nIt probably wasn\'t necessary to order a double portion. But I finished it all anyway.  \\n\\nThe spicy seasoning for the bibim was hotter and more stimulating than expected, but it was delicious.  \\nThe buckwheat pancake had a rich aroma and was delightfully chewy.  \\n\\nFor reference, other regulars were ordering `boiled pork slices` (suyuk), so I\'ll have to try that next time I visit.\\n## Pictures\\n<pictures>\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/b6b8df122c2c9b3d253cb8fc87f385c9.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Songjeong Beach Makguksu Haeundae Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/c3c72811c466a6aea2e35e3afeed3318.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Songjeong Beach Makguksu Haeundae Branch\\">\\n<img src=\\"/assets/snippets/location/3fd8213a8f30ee0a40169a95d95dcd61.jpg\\" style=\\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; object-fit: contain;\\" alt=\\"Songjeong Beach Makguksu Haeundae Branch\\">\\n</pictures>\\n"}')}}]);